# Pairs with PeerAuthorityBounded. The captured-source confinement passes a report
# naming no source, so an unknown backup is replayed under system origin.
MODULE: PeerRestoreEmptySourceListElevates
TARGET: PeerAuthorityBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an elevated prepare builds from a backup whose admission report names no source
PERTURBS: Prepare

--- FIND
          ELSE IF up /\ ~SourcesEnrolled(b, t)
--- REPLACE
          ELSE IF up /\ Sources(b, t) # {} /\ ~SourcesEnrolled(b, t)
--- END
